subckt dut (VDD VSS Vin Vout)
C1 (net3 Vin) capacitor c=1p
C2 (Vout VSS) capacitor c=1p
Cfb (Vout Vin) capacitor c=1p
M1 (net1 net3 VDD VDD) pch_ulvt_mac l=150n m=1 nf=1 w=1u
M2 (net1 net3 VSS VSS) nch_ulvt_mac l=150n m=1 nf=1 w=1u
M3 (net2 net1 VDD VDD) pch_ulvt_mac l=150n m=1 nf=1 w=1u
M4 (net0 net1 VSS VSS) nch_ulvt_mac l=150n m=1 nf=1 w=1u
M5 (Vout net2 VDD VDD) pch_ulvt_mac l=150n m=1 nf=1 w=1u
M6 (Vout net0 VSS VSS) nch_ulvt_mac l=150n m=1 nf=1 w=1u
R1 (net2 net0) resistor r=1k
